+// vendor guidance says to choose between them experimentally for geometry that
+// is rebuilt often, and these are: a board rebuilds on roughly four frames in
+// five. Measured on the same board frame, 28547 triangles:
+//
+//                       build     trace     BLAS
+//   PREFER_FAST_TRACE   1.23 ms   3.71 ms   1874 KB
+//   PREFER_FAST_BUILD   0.94 ms   3.50 ms   1590 KB
+//
+// Cheaper to build and 15% smaller, with the trace unchanged inside noise --
+// the structure is thrown away too often to earn what fast trace costs to make.
+// The top-level structure keeps PREFER_FAST_TRACE, which is the guidance for it.
+// AURORA_RT_SLOW_BUILD reinstates the old choice.
